{"id":"vod_sn_35649","vodId":"35649","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天狼","name_cn":"天狼","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9cb1a5930371cf6e7e5281d352103c26.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在昭和初年，一群打扮神秘举止怪异的人在夜幕的笼罩下来到了帝都东京府，他们是世世代代都在追踪和狩猎吸血鬼的吸血鬼猎人。　　尤里（上村佑翔 配音）虽然身处吸血鬼猎人的阵营之内，却是非常特殊的存在，因为他的体内流淌着人类和狼人的两种血液，因此拥有着比普通人类更为强健的体魄。威拉德（堀内贤雄 配音）拥有着丰厚的学识，是军师和领袖般的存在。多萝西娅（森奈奈子 配音）外表火辣，却拥有着截然相反的冷静头脑，无论怎样紧要的危机时刻都能做出正确的判断。菲利普（小林裕介 配音）年纪虽小，却拥有着极为复杂的过去。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Py2zVWyx6i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KFuNzAetWD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pLHUVNnbgY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XcQZhWej641/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GZgJLPCpMb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Dd0u7YaGrS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HvfQV0ZEUi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z8XNUfuRj71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HFyK8efgS51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DMmmiXpVME1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c2DEtwwuiZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8EfdXEu7hX1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.339Z"}